[OPTIONS]
  Units CMH
  Headloss H-W
  Accuracy 0.001
  Trials 200
  Damplimit 0.01

[TITLE]
Check valve at zero demand (Hazen-Williams). The bypass carries a slowly
converging residual flow that pushes the CV into its barrier region.

[JUNCTIONS]
; ID        Elevation  Demand
  Outlet    0          0

[RESERVOIRS]
; ID        Head
  Supply    5

[PIPES]
; ID        From     To      Length  Diameter  Roughness  MinorLoss  Status
  Check     Supply   Outlet  1       150       130        2          CV
  Bypass    Supply   Outlet  1000    1         130        0          OPEN

[TIMES]
  Duration 2:00
  Hydraulic Timestep 1:00
  Report Timestep 1:00

[COORDINATES]
Supply 0 0
Outlet 1 0

[END]
